t tariff-related demand, gaming and wearables are also trending lower following promotional activity earlier in the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/alpha-and-omega-semi-aosl-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AOSL 2026 Q2","e":"aosl","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Chang","x":"Inventory digestion in AI further impacted by shifts in GPU allocation to prioritize data centers over graphic card markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/alpha-and-omega-aosl-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AOSL 2026 Q2","e":"aosl","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Chang","x":"And more recently, this momentum has extended into our high-performance medium voltage MOSFETs used in applications such as hot swap and intermediate bus converters for AI data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/alpha-and-omega-aosl-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AOSL 2026 Q2","e":"aosl","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stephen Chang","x":"Within computing, we saw softness following an unusually strong September that benefited from tariff-related PC pull-ins as well as earlier AI and graph shipments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/alpha-and-omega-aosl-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AOSL 2026 Q3","e":"aosl","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Chang","x":"This strategy is translating into tangible results, particularly in advanced computing, where demand is broadening across AI data center applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/aosl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AOSL 2026 Q3","e":"aosl","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Chang","x":"We have stepped up our targeted R&D investments in areas where we are already seeing success, including power ICs, high-performance MOSFETs for AI and data center applications, and advanced solutions for smartphones.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/aosl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AOSL 2026 Q3","e":"aosl","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Craig Ellis","x":"…the course of the year, and this is more of a question for you, Yifan, but how do we think about the give and takes between what could be rising chip costs and potentially your ability to either offset those or pass those through, and then the potential for volume to benefit overhead absorption?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/aosl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AOSL 2026 Q4","e":"aosl","d":"2026-08-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Chang","x":"As our portfolio expands into higher performance applications, we are increasing content per platform, broadening customer adoption and strengthening our competitive position in AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/alpha-omega-aosl-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AOSL 2026 Q4","e":"aosl","d":"2026-08-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Chang","x":"Demand for our medium-voltage MOSFET portfolio continues to expand across AI and cloud infrastructure with growing engagement from power supply providers, module makers, leading ODMs, cloud service providers, and hyperscale customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/alpha-omega-aosl-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AOSL 2026 Q4","e":"aosl","d":"2026-08-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen Chang","x":"But at the same time, there's a little more ability to -- for consumers to bear some of the price increases there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/alpha-omega-aosl-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AOSL 2027 Q1","e":"aosl","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen C